      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a protocol for moving mRNA vaccine shipments across multiple international borders. Can you give me a high-level checklist of the critical requirements for maintaining the cold chain during transit? Especially things we need to watch out for to prevent temperature excursions.",
